  "story": "Manual regression case for task #48 (LRS-investor flag): India-only individual resident who remitted ₹18,00,000 abroad under the Liberalised Remittance Scheme for a gift/donation to a non-resident relative. Fires lrs_investment_tcs (s.206C(1G) TCS on the ₹8,00,000 excess over the ₹10L base threshold, at 20%) and the form_27d document trigger. Independently exercises the \"gift_donation\" branch of computeLrsTcs's purpose dispatch -- the only other real/fuzz profile that ever reaches this code path (india_ror_us_income) only ever exercises the \"investment\" branch, so \"gift_donation\" was otherwise untested by any golden fixture or fuzz-corpus profile.",
